OL,3,GNEWSAInvestigation into foam-covered
OL,4,Ariver continues
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn investigation into how white foam
OL,7,Fappeared on a river is still ongoing a
OL,8,Fyear later.
OL,10,FOn 18 October last year, the substance
OL,11,F- compared to snow or washing up liquid
OL,12,F- was seen on the River Thet in
OL,13,FThetford, Norfolk.
OL,15,FIt led to the death of an estimated
OL,16,F1,000 juvenile fish and fry.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
