OL,3,GNEWSAInvestigation into foam-covered
OL,4,Ariver continues
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt the time, the Environment Agency
OL,7,Fsaid it had detected the source and any
OL,8,Ffurther discharge was stopped. In an
OL,9,Fupdate, a spokesperson said "good
OL,10,Fprogress" had been made, but the
OL,11,Fresults of the inquiry were still being
OL,12,Fdecided.
